</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Lighting and turn signal switch
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Charging system
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
B1A82: Battery Voltage Too High
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Power supply circuit voltage from “IG1 SIG” fuse is higher than 16 V for specified time continuously.
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
